DESCRIPTION:Africa Industrialization Day falls on November 20 by proclamati
 on of the UN General Assembly\, which designated it in December 1989 withi
 n the framework of the Second Industrial Development Decade for Africa. It
  is an advocacy day rather than a celebration: its subject is manufacturin
 g on the continent and what stands in the way of more of it. Since 2018 th
 e date has anchored a longer African Union event\, Africa Industrialisatio
 n Week.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/africa-industrialization-da
 y/
